-- תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה, פרק 1ב, §1.33 ניכוי מס ועד
-- The deduction of house-committee dues: the section names the collective
-- agreement that governs it and states no rule of its own beyond that.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `1.33 ניכוי מס ועד`

-- The section's whole text under its heading is the agreement's name and
-- date. The agreement itself is not in the corpus (the source page links
-- it as a separate document), so what it sets is an input of this file,
-- never a number in it.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_33__hc_2/p1
GIVEN `the deduction the agreement of 17.3.85 sets` IS A NUMBER @desc the house-committee dues the collective agreement signed in Jerusalem on 17.3.85 says are deducted from the teaching employee's salary in the month; set by that agreement, not by the takanon
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `house-committee dues deducted` `the deduction the agreement of 17.3.85 sets` IS
    `the deduction the agreement of 17.3.85 sets`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_33__hc_3/p1 The section's source (אסמכתא): a director-general's circular.

-- Placeholder: 50 stands for whatever the 17.3.85 agreement sets.
#ASSERT `house-committee dues deducted` 50 EQUALS 50
